@1 = ~Acidosis~
@2 = ~Acidosis
(Evocation)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

The caster deliberately poisons their own blood with acid. On casting, the caster suffers acid damage equal to 15% of their current hit points. For the duration of the spell, any creature striking the caster in melee suffers 1d2 points of acid damage and a -3 penalty to THAC0 for 3 rounds, with no saving throw. The THAC0 penalty does not stack with itself.~
